   275	ASCII bytes
   276	`//go:cgo_import_dynamic`. Any failure occurs before `go build`.
   277	
   278	Only the fingerprinted `go` executable and its regular executable children
   279	below fingerprinted `GOROOT/pkg/tool/<GOHOSTOS>_<GOHOSTARCH>/` may start. The
   280	source snapshot MUST be read-only to child processes and unchanged until the
   281	last child exits. The one output MUST be a bounded regular file inside manager
   282	staging. The manager MUST hash it, set manager-defined executable permissions,
   283	and MUST NOT execute it for validation, version discovery, smoke testing,
   284	post-processing, receipt generation, rollback, or any other reason.
