+most one optional cache-build lock, which is released, then the manager-home
+mutation lock. A process MUST NOT acquire a project or cache-build lock while
+holding the home lock. Recovery and standalone GC acquire only the home lock.
+Private validation and compilation may run concurrently for independent
+projects; shared publication, commit, rollback, recovery, repair, and GC are
+serialized.
